OL,3,AUS attorney general dodges questions
OL,4,Aabout Nvidia investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Attorney General Todd Blanche has
OL,7,Fbacked Nvidia as a "good corporate
OL,8,Fcitizen" while refusing to comment on
OL,9,Fwhether the AI chipmaker was under
OL,10,Ffederal investigation.
OL,12,FBlanche said he had no information
OL,13,Fabout newly reinstated CEO Jensen
OL,14,FHuang's security clearance status, as
OL,15,Flawmakers demand answers about
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump's involvement in
OL,17,FHuang's comeback.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795562656
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUS attorney general dodges questions
OL,4,Aabout Nvidia investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuang was given his job back less than
OL,7,Ftwo weeks after being forced to resign
OL,8,Fover revelations of extramarital
OL,9,Faffairs, including one with an alleged
OL,10,FChinese spy.
OL,12,FAsked several times on Tuesday if the
OL,13,Fjustice department or FBI had
OL,14,Finvestigated Huang, Blanche responded:
OL,15,F"I don't know what you're talking
OL,16,Fabout."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
